{\b InputLine}\par
InputLine lets you use your Steam Controller with full Steam Input on this PC while you stream to an iPad or iPhone with any streaming app.\par
This installer sets up {\b inputline-host} as the InputLine service. It starts with Windows, allows the InputLine app on your local network (and Tailscale) through the firewall, and plugs in a virtual Steam Controller through usbip-win2 when your controller connects.\par
